WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:18.070
We plan to attack Karasumori tonight.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.270
I see.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.240
So which one did you select?

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:23.940
The feathers.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:29.320
I would like to borrow three feathers.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.350
Shirahago, huh? They may be
the right ones for the job.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.480
If you'll excuse me...

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.290
This is...

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.890
It's a newly developed Booster Serum.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.330
I doubt you'll need it,
but take it just in case.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:54.410
The Kekkaishi of Karasumori must
be approached with caution.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.140
Yes. Sir!

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:07.800
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.660
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:14.870
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:16.770
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:20.210
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:24.610
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:28.150
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:31.490
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:37.150
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.660
Sha la la la la...

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:48.070
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:50.040
(Secret romance)

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:55.240
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.010
(A strange distance)

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:03.850
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:04.920
Yeah

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:08.390
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.990
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:17.330
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.340
Hoi! Joso!

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.070
Ketsu!

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:40.380
All right!

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.790
I got the hang of making
multiple Kekkai at once.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.760
I can make up for
a lack of strength with this.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:50.500
But there's a limit to my powers.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.160
I can't do this
too many times in a day.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.290
Grandma...

00:02:56.670 --> 00:03:00.400
The Kekkai technique requires more
than just brute force.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.510
That technique is not suited for you.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:12.740
I'm off.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.250
What is suited for me?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:20.850
Yoshimori.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.460
That's rare for him
to leave before me.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.170
He's acting strange lately.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.130
Always thinking about something.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:33.570
I think he's avoiding me a little too.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.570
When he went to fix
Lord Uro's bed

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.340
he left me behind.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:44.680
But one thing's for sure...
he's hiding something.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:50.420
Maybe he's secretly training to
come up with a new technique.

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:57.060
This is a pain in the neck.
I should just ask him.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:58.850
Yoshimori!

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.340
Hey, Tokine!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.600
What? This?

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.670
I'm drinking the ones
I forgot to drink,

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.770
so I'm combining three of them.

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:16.880
And, you probably don't know this
since you're in high school,

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.910
but today's school lunch
has coffee milk. Too!

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:20.940
Hey!

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.510
I lost the urge to ask.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.680
I hate myself

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.160
for being even slightly interested
in that stupid brat!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.330
Did I do something to make her mad?

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.840
They're definitely not normal.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.930
These last 30 days felt so long.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.970
Your next 30 days will
feel just as long.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.200
Shut up!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.010
I'll win today!

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.720
You can do it, Nakameguro!

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.840
Show Sumimura what you're made of!

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.320
- Ready?!
- Go!

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:54.350
- Rock, paper...
- Rock, paper...

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:55.480
- Scissors!
- Scissors!

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.160
All right! The coffee milk is mine!

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:01.520
It's the monthly coffee milk battle!

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:04.590
Nakameguro was able to
get revenge for his loss last month.

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:07.660
It was a close one.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.530
Ichigaya and I had bet three
pencil leads on you, you know.

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:12.800
Shut up.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.510
Darn it! I won't lose next time!

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.140
Bring it on!

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:23.550
What is it that gets young men
so riled up like that?

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:26.940
I don't get it.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:31.060
Assuming that Hazama Tokimori
came to the Karasumori Site

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:34.190
that used to be
inhabited by the gods...

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.990
then what?

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.690
How am I supposed to
learn more about this?

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.070
What's this?

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.070
Hey, Grandpa Shige!

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.070
There's something I wanna ask you.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:02.080
Yuri, you are so scatterbrained!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.750
No one's ever said that
about me before.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.130
What's wrong?

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.720
The feathers... just now...

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:13.860
Feathers?

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:15.930
Is there a donation
drive somewhere?

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.400
No... I guess it was just
my imagination.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.300
You want to know about
the Kekkai?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:29.840
Yeah. It says here that the Kekkai
becomes weaker

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:33.510
as the Caster moves
further away from it.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.610
Yes.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.680
That means. In order to maintain
a Kekkai from far away,

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.750
you'd need a separate source
of power.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:45.260
In Lord Uro's case.
It was that Magic Device, right?

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:49.630
But since it surrounds something
as powerful as a god,

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:50.970
it breaks from time to time.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.440
That's why we have to go
and fix it.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.200
Am I right?

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.240
Yes, you are.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.610
But why do you ask?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:05.380
I-It's not wrong for me to want to
know about Kekkai. Is it?

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.460
But it makes sense
when I think about it.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:12.560
You need something with power
to suppress power.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:17.390
That means Karasumori's seal
must be enormously powerful.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:23.400
Maybe Hazama Tokimori needed
the land for this reason?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:27.240
But the seal isn't perfect anyway.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:33.450
Will I really be able to seal
the Karasumori Site forever?

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:41.850
There has to be a good way.
Like that bed's Kekkai...

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.950
It was different from our Kekkai.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.090
If I can do that...

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:53.930
You know. That bed
felt fundamentally different

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:57.300
from the Kekkai we use.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.340
Yoshimori. Don't rush things.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:03.940
I had you go because
it was a rare opportunity.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.740
Just remember the feeling
you experienced then.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:08.650
Just the feeling?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.610
Lord Uro's bed is
way beyond someone like you

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:16.820
who can't even master
the Hazama Style.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:24.560
Tokimori-sama developed
the Hazama Style Kekkai Techniques

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.300
so they would be simple to
understand and use. It's just one method.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.330
That...

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.170
That is a little different...

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:38.100
Either way, you should only focus
on your current training for now.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:41.240
Learn how to use the powers for now.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:46.840
Having powers without knowing
the proper way to use it, can only cause harm.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.450
I've said this before.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:53.320
But there's something strange
happening in Karasumori lately.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.120
Be careful.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:02.860
Cut it out already.

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:06.170
Young people are supposed
to have a lot on their mind.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:09.770
But acting before thinking is
one of your strong points, right?

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.380
Hey, Madarao?

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.770
What kind of person
was Hazama Tokimori?

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.840
What?! Master Tokimori?

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:18.980
Well. Of course he was a handsome man!

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:26.260
He was slim, had a gentle demeanor,
a little stylish, but sometimes very manly!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.690
That's not what I meant.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:29.700
His eyes! His eyes were wonderful!

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.590
Oh, but I guess the best thing was
his voice!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.970
It was a little deep and
sent chills down my spine...

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.300
So...

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.460
Just imagine a voice like that calling
"Madarao..."!

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.910
You'd listen and do
just about anything he asked!

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.500
Listen to me too. Damn it!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:50.780
I meant. How did he cast
his Kekkai?

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:52.640
The same way you do.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.920
No. Not that kind.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:59.650
Oh well... I'll just try it...

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.590
It went like this...

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.500
Why are you straining like that?

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:12.070
How do I do it. Damn it?!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:15.670
No calm down.
Try to remember that feeling.

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:29.220
If I had to choose doing it the same way
my older brother did it might be easier to grasp.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.120
Yoshimori...

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.430
Yoshimori!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.170
What? Don't scare me like that!

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.800
What were you trying to do just now?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.010
What? Nothing.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.850
I don't really understand,

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.350
but you were trying to do
something dangerous. Am I right?

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.150
What do you mean,
something dangerous?

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.550
Like I said, I don't really understand,
but it felt that way.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:04.690
You've always been like this.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.520
The moment I take
my eyes off of you-

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.320
Shut up! Stop treating me
like a kid all the time!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.570
Hey! Wait!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:16.770
That's right. I'll do it even if
people tell me it's impossible!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.070
I'm a man of my word!

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.970
What's with him? So annoying!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:26.480
Going through a rebellious stage now?
What a temper!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.080
That's the Karasumori Site.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:36.250
Just as I explained earlier,

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.850
buy some time there,
and you'll gain power.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.060
Can we wreak havoc?

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:55.710
Of course, as long as you do
what I told you to.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.400
To confuse the Kekkaishi.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.710
You'll invade from three directions:
The sky, ground, and from underground.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.510
But don't go too deep underground.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.790
After entry, stay at your posts.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.120
Don't fight back when found
by the Kekkaishi.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.960
Just evade them in
your respective positions.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.090
I'll let you know when
the time has come.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.730
After that, you can do
whatever you want.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:18.290
How foolish.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:21.740
Come now. It's based on the data.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:23.530
I'm saying that's foolish.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.840
I'm sure you three don't want
to be punished.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:30.900
Go!

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.880
So what are you plotting?

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.040
Shut up!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.380
I have an idea.

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:44.290
You're asking about
Master Tokimori and the Kekkai

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:48.560
because you want to know
about Karasumori, right?

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.830
And you're keeping it
a secret from that girl

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.660
because it could lead to danger.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:58.960
You're probably thinking of
sealing the powers of Karasumori, right?

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:04.140
- Bull's-eye! What a stupid child you are!
- What?!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:06.340
Even Master Tokimori couldn't do it.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.580
What makes you think you can?

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.940
You never know until you try!

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:16.010
You're right. But a smart person would
know before they try though...

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:21.190
Say what you want.
I'm going to do it!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.790
I'm not going to stop you.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.720
The others may oppose this,

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:30.830
but being a little reckless
really suits you.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.470
Don't tell Tokine. Madarao.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:36.670
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.510
She seems to be in a bad mood.

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:42.680
I wonder what he was trying to do...

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.590
It didn't feel right to me.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:51.050
I don't know why but
I feel so frustrated.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.230
There's more than one.
They've come all at once.

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.160
There are three. Let's go, Hakubi.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.630
Did you find them, Madarao?

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.230
This is odd.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:04.260
What is?

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.500
I smell the same Ayakashi coming
from different directions.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.800
What do you mean by that?

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:16.880
Yoshimori. There are others.
So hurry up and get them!

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.110
I know!

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.140
Ketsu!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:26.020
You're hopeless! Such a huge Kekkai
and you didn't even touch it.

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.080
Just you watch!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:31.060
I can do something as long as I'm close!

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.640
Is this an attack?!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.000
Ketsu!

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:45.900
It ran away?!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.310
There it is!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.850
- Honey!
- What?!

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:54.210
There's another intruder.

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:58.060
This smell. It's a human.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.110
A human?

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:01.090
Wait!

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:09.530
I see. He can use Kekkai
as footing to fight in midair.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.370
I should report this.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:16.340
He's not as accurate from afar
but theoretically

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.470
you can place Kekkai anywhere
as long as you know where to place it.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.850
This technique could be more
troublesome than I heard.

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:24.170
Ketsu!

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:32.120
It can fragment its own body
and control it?

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.450
My Kekkai isn't strong enough
to withstand it

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:35.830
if it attacks a single focused point.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.090
This is a huge pain!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.220
I'll catch you
even if I have to do it in pieces!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:41.520
Ketsu!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:43.360
Metsu!

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:52.310
You brat!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.670
Is it time? Is it time yet?!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.450
What is it talking about?

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.560
As expected it seems
its regenerative powers have increased.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:06.550
Hurry it up!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:10.490
This human brat is taking me
a bit lightly.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.130
My patience is running out!

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:14.760
It's transforming already?!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.430
We thought the closer
you are to Karasumori

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:19.270
the faster you gain power.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.600
Nothing yet from the lookout.

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:25.040
The other two on land and
underground haven't morphed yet?

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.310
This is interesting.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:32.350
Time isn't the only factor in gaining power
from Karasumori. There's something else.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.580
Very well.

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:41.260
Permission... granted!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.930
Let the battle begin.

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:01.350
So we can run wild now!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.020
That was sooner than I thought.

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:08.150
I guess I'll have to use that
when I see a chance.

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:11.250
Ketsu!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.990
Blocking the attack
isn't much of a problem

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.730
but I can't see where it is.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:19.390
Ketsu!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:22.890
Joso!

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:23.930
Ketsu!

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:24.960
Metsu!

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.970
I missed! Kai!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.050
Why, you-!

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.710
As expected
it regenerates right away.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:43.350
I can't attack parts of it.
I have to crush all of it.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.710
Hizuki!

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.990
Did they do this to you?!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:49.960
Don't interfere.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:50.990
Wait.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.970
The three of us are one and the same.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.930
Your enemy is my enemy.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.190
Isn't that right?

00:17:57.100 --> 00:18:00.770
And we are all equal.
Don't go off on your own.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.570
How did you get those powers?

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.510
So that's what you're after.

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:07.340
Don't worry.
I'll give some of it to you later.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.510
Joso! Ketsu!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.110
What? A three-layered Kekkai?!

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.550
Fuzuki!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.180
Metsu!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:22.620
Those fools!
Linking up too soon like that

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.100
it's like they are asking to be
attacked all at once.

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:28.630
But that multi-layered Kekkai...

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:32.330
I wonder if that increases
its strength and power.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.400
You... brats!

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:36.570
Hizuki...

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.910
Now it's meaningless.

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:42.440
I thought that we could be free
if we gained power.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:46.150
But that only matters if
all three of us are together!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:50.060
Mizuki, are you saying you want to quit?

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:51.950
Of course not.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:55.890
How can I quiet my rage
if I don't kill them?

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:00.030
You have the powers of Karasumori too.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:06.470
This is bad. Their Negative Energy
increased suddenly!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.510
W-What's going on?!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.070
They fused together!

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.120
Yoshimori!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.620
Oh no!

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:26.960
Madarao!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:47.340
Thanks to the power of Karasumori,

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:50.540
we have made up for losing Fuzuki's share
of strength. We're exceeding it.

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:53.220
Our powers are still increasing!

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:59.090
Wonderful! So this is the power
of Karasumori...

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.330
Now then.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:16.180
I finally... have a better view.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.110
I'm not going to miss the next time.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:28.950
Now, what are you going to do, Kekkaishi...
guardians of Karasumori?

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:41.560
Here it comes!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:42.660
Kai!

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:51.780
Hey, honey! Are you okay?

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:56.650
This is bad!
At this rate...

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:57.870
I won't be able to hold it off!

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.730
Are you all right, Tokine?

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:20.060
Y-Yeah.

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:22.930
Yoshimori. When did he get so close?

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:25.040
And this Kekkai...

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.680
He blocked that attack
with just one layer?

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.150
He had the flexibility to create two
at the same time...

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.240
Tokine!

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:37.720
Those arrow-like things it's shooting
are part of it, right?

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:42.250
So I think we should attack it
when they return to the body.

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.160
What do you think?

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:47.730
Well, that would be the quickest way...

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:50.130
Then can you help me a little?

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:56.540
They withstood the attack this time.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:58.910
But the next attack will
probably be the last.

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:02.310
This land is splendid.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:06.880
My only goal was the experiment
but at this rate we can take over!

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.820
Playtime is over!
I'll put an end to you both right now.

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:18.630
Let's go, Tokine!

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:19.850
Okay!

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:52.560
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:56.970
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:01.270
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.700
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:18.190
I feel like I could fly
for the one I love

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:26.930
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:31.760
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:40.370
Don't cry

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:49.120
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:53.950
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:53.990 --> 00:24:02.370
Don't cry
